<%# Opening sentence of the producing-house followups (standard and first-time),
    rendered inside a paragraph. The composing template passes in_person: false
    for an order with no in-person tickets (e.g. streaming-only), which must not
    talk about a visit to the theater. first_time and personal come from
    first_time_followup (personal = TheaterInfo#first_person?). %>
<% hope = local_assigns[:personal] ? 'I hope' : 'We hope' %>
<% if !in_person %>
  <%= hope %> you enjoyed the performance and will return soon (there are a few suggestions in the sidebar on the right, but check our website for all upcoming events).
<% elsif local_assigns[:first_time] %>
  <%= hope %> you had a good evening and will return soon (there are a few suggestions in the sidebar on the right, but check our website for all upcoming events).
<% else %>
  We hope you had a good time here at the theater and will return soon (there are a few suggestions in
  the sidebar on the right, but check our website for all upcoming events).
<% end %>
